              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "From {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} \n-- Identify the employee name and set it as value to \"searchWorkerName\" variable. \n     --- If employee name is not found but found, but intent is a fallow up question of previous person or found pronouns of people(like him/her/this/same) then try and get the employee name form the most recent previous user question which has the employee name from {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}} and set it as value to \"searchWorkerName\".\n-- Determine whether search context is direct reports or all reports - set either DIRECTS or ALL as value to the \"reports\" variable respectively. By default, set ALL."
            }
          ],
