          },
          "code": "FETCH_REVIEW_PERIODS",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1771215593559",
          "id": "1770702456735",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"title\": \"Logged In User Response\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"items\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"ReviewPeriodId\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"ReviewPeriodName\":{\n            \"type\":\"String\"\n           },\n\t\t   \"StartDate\":{\n\t\t\t\"type\":\"date\"\n\t\t   },\n\t\t   \"EndDate\":{\n\t\t\t\"type\":\"date\"\n\t\t   }\t\t   \n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"items\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "BO_FUNCTION"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Check multiple employee match"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "true": "1771219322892",
            "false": "1771213076261"
          },
          "code": "CHECK_MULTIPLE_EMPLOYEE_MATCH",
          "convergenceTargetId": "end",
          "id": "1771218220888",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771218220889_1",
              "name": "condition",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$variables.employeeSearchResults === null || $context.$variables.employeeSearchResults.length === 0}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "CONDITION"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Review Period Date Range Decoder"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770706352326"
          },
          "code": "REVIEW_PERIOD_DATE_RANGE_DECODER",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1771215593559",
          "id": "1770702943119",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770702943121_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Determine Today's date: Convert ServerTime from {{$context.$variables.loggedInUserDetails.ServerTime}} to YYYY-MM-DD format to determine today's date.\n\nNow decode the {{$context.$variables.userQuery}}  and determine StartDate and EndDate using today's date and below DATE INTERPRETATION RULES\n\n\nDATE INTERPRETATION RULES\n\nInput Interpretation:\n\n- Basic Rules\n\t- Missing year : Use current year\n\t- Date ranges : Interpret as same year unless spanning months like \"Dec to Jan\"\n\n- Relative Timeframes\n  Translate natural language periods into exact date ranges using today's date (assume 2025-04-12 as an example):\n\t- This year : 2025-01-01 to 2025-12-31\n\t- Last year : 2024-01-01 to 2024-12-31\n\t- Last X years : The X full calendar years prior to the current year\n\t\t- Example :\n\t\t\t-  \"Last 5 years\" : 2020-01-01 to 2024-12-31\n\t\t\t-  \"Last 3 years\" : 2022-01-01 to 2024-12-31\n\t- Next year : 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31\n\t- This month : 2025-04-01 to 2025-04-30\n\t- Last month : 2025-03-01 to 2025-03-31\n\t- Last X months : The X full calendar months before the current month\n\t\t- Example:\n\t\t\t-  \"Last 2 months\" : 2025-02-01 to 2025-03-31\n\t\t\t-  \"Last 4 months\" : 2024-12-01 to 2025-03-31\n\t- Last week : The full calendar week before the current week. \n\t\t- Example:\n\t\t\t- Week starting 2025-03-31 to 2025-04-06\n\t- Last X weeks : X full calendar weeks before the current week\n\t\t- Example:\n\t\t\t-  \"Last 3 weeks\" : 2025-03-17 to 2025-04-06\n\t- Past week : The last 7 days, including today : 2025-04-06 to 2025-04-12\n\t- Past X days/weeks/months : Count backward from today\n\t\t- Example:\n\t\t\t-   \"Past 2 months\" : 2025-02-12 to 2025-04-12\n\t\t\t-   \"Past 4 months\" : 2024-12-12 to 2025-04-12\n\t\t\t-   \"Past 3 weeks\" : 2025-03-22 to 2025-04-12\n\t\t\t-   \"Past 10 days\" : 2025-04-02 to 2025-04-12\n\t- Past Year (rolling 12-month window) : 2024-04-12 to 2025-04-12\n\n\nNow identify the correct review period record from {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_REVIEW_PERIODS.$output.items}}. If the {{$context.$variables.userQuery}} does not have specification of any date/date range then find the most recent review period record. Otherwise find review period record that is matching the range of StartDate and EndDate determined above and then set corresponding values from the record to reviewPeriodId, reviewPeriodName, reviewPeriodStartDate and reviewPeriodEndDate variables."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"reviewPeriodName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"reviewPeriodId\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n        },\n        \"reviewPeriodEndDate\": {\n            \"type\": \"date\"\n        },\n        \"reviewPeriodStartDate\": {\n            \"type\": \"date\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Employee Selection User Prompt"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "EMPLOYEE_SELECTION_USER_PROMPT",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1771218437817",
          "id": "1771213076261",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771213076264_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Inform the user that there are multiple employees with similar name. Then show the list of Employee Name, Assignment Number and Person Number of each employee from {{$context.$nodes.EMPLOYEE_SEARCH.$output.items}} to the user and ask him to provide you the exact employee from the list so that you will be able to provide details."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
