          },
          "code": "EMPLOYEE_NOT_FOUND_USER_SUMMARY",
          "id": "1771218807731",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771218807732_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Clearly mention to the user that you are not able to find employee whose details he is looking for in a professional tone."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Data Fetch Decoder"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770721142878"
          },
          "code": "DATA_FETCH_DECODER",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1771215593559",
          "id": "1770706352326",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770706352329_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Understand {{$context.$variables.userQuery}} and set the corresponding fields in dataObects variable to true. And set other fields as false.\n\nWhen {{$context.$variables.userQuery}} is about a worker's goals in general, then set both performanceGoals and developmentGoals field values in dataObjects to true.\n\nIf the intent of {{$context.$variables.userQuery}} is clear, then based on {{$context.$variables.userQuery}} set relevant fields in dataObjects variable to true. Set all other non relevant fields in dataObjects variable to false.\n\nIf the {{$context.$variables.userQuery}} in not straight forward and you are not able to identify what is the intent and data user is looking for, then use the following examples to identify which field values to set to true on different query patterns of {{$context.$variables.userQuery}} .\n\na. \"How is [employee] performing?\"\n\tset fallowing fields in dataObjects to true\n\t- performanceEvaluations\n\t- checkIns\n\t- feedback\nb. \"What feedback has [employee] received?\"\n\tset fallowing fields in dataObjects to true\n\t- performanceEvaluations\n\t- checkIns\n\t- feedback\n\t- performanceGoals\n\t- developmentGoals\n\t- recognitions\nc. \"What are people saying about [employee]?\"\n\tset fallowing fields in dataObjects to true\n\t- performanceEvaluations\n\t- feedback\nd. \"What are the main development areas for [employee]?\"\n\tset fallowing fields in dataObjects to true\n\t- performanceEvaluations\n\t- checkIns\n\t- developmentGoals\ne. \"Show the talent rating information of [employee]?\" or \"Evaluate the talent rating of [employee]?\" or \"Give the complete talent rating of [employee]?\"\n\tset fallowing fields in dataObjects to true\n\t- talentRatings\nf. \"Show the profile information of [employee]?\" or \"Show the skill and qualification of [employee]\" or \"Give me the certifications and competencies of [employee]\"\n\tset fallowing fields in dataObjects to true\n\t- profileInformation\ng. \"what is the latest feedback given to [employee]?\"\n\tset fallowing fields in dataObjects to true\n\t- performanceEvaluations\n\t- checkIns\n\t- feedback\n\t- performanceGoals\n\t- developmentGoals\n\t- recognitions"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"dataObects\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {\n\t\t\"performanceEvaluations\": {\"type\":\"boolean\"},\n\t\t\"checkIns\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\n\t\t\"feedback\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\n\t\t\"performanceGoals\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\n\t\t\"developmentGoals\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\n\t\t\"recognitions\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\n                \"profileInformation\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\n                \"talentRatings\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"}\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Run in Parallel"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "0": "1770721256655",
