        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Employee Data summarizer"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "EMPLOYEE_DATA_SUMMARIZER",
          "id": "1771219388007",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771219388008_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Summarize the response based on what fields of {{$context.$nodes.DATA_FETCH_DECODER.$output.dataObects}} value is true. For example if {{$context.$nodes.DATA_FETCH_DECODER.$output.dataObects.performanceEvaluations}} value is true then include performance evaluations data in response. \nDo not include corresponding data of those fields whose value is false.  For example if {{$context.$nodes.DATA_FETCH_DECODER.$output.dataObects.checkIns}} value is false then do not include checkins data in response. But do not mention anything about any fields or values of those fields in the response.\n\n\nDATA FOR RESPONSE\n\nData of Performance Evaluations, Checkins, Anytime feedback, Requested feedback, Performance goals, Development goals, recognitions, Profile Information and Talent Ratings can be found in below data sets respectively.\n- {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_PERFORAMNCE_EVALUATIONNS.$output}},\n- {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_CHECKINS.$output}}\n- {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_ANYTIME_FEEDBACK.$output}}\n- {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_REQUESTED_FEEDBACK.$output}}\n- {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_PERFORMANCE_GOAL_SUMMARY.$output}}\n- {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_DEVELOPMENT_GOALS.$output}}\n- {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_RECOGNITIONS.$output}}\n- {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_PROFILE_INFORMATION.$output}}\n- {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_TALENT_RATINGS.$output}} \n\nAnd considered review period data present in {{$context.$nodes.REVIEW_PERIOD_DATE_RANGE_DECODER.$output.reviewPeriodName}}, {{$context.$nodes.REVIEW_PERIOD_DATE_RANGE_DECODER.$output.reviewPeriodStartDate}}, {{$context.$nodes.REVIEW_PERIOD_DATE_RANGE_DECODER.$output.reviewPeriodStartDate}} for user queries related to Performance Evaluations, Checkins, Anytime feedback, Requested feedback, Performance goals, Development goals, recognitions. Do not consider review period for Profile Information and Talent Ratings. \n\n\n\nRESPONSE FORMATTING RULES\n\n- Start with a short, high-level summary sentence.\n- Use bullet points or paragraph blocks for clarity.\n- When listing items (e.g., check-ins, feedback or goals), show:\n\t1. Date: [Month Day, Year]\n\t2. Author/Source: [Name]\n\t3. Content: [Comment or rating]\n- Always mention the name of the review period or year when used.\n- When listing Talent Ratings, show only the level values\n- When listing Profile Information, show only the sections asked in user query\n\n\n\nRESPONDING TO QUERY PATTERNS\n\nWhen forming responses, combine data from multiple relevant sources when needed - even if the user asks a general question. Use this guide:\n\nUse the following examples to identify which information areas to reference based on different query patterns. Consider these patterns when formulating your response.\n\na. \"How is [employee] performing?\"\n\tRefer to information from:\n\t- Performance Evaluations\n\t- Check-ins\n\t- Requested Feedback\n\t- Anytime Feedback\nb. \"What feedback has [employee] received?\"\n\tRefer to information from:\n\t- Performance Evaluations\n\t- Check-ins\n\t- Requested Feedback\n\t- Anytime Feedback\n\t- Performance Goals\n\t- Development Goals\n\t- Celebrate Recognitions\nc. \"What are people saying about [employee]?\"\n\tRefer to information from:\n\t- Performance Evaluations\n\t- Requested Feedback\n\t- Anytime Feedback\nd. \"What are the main development areas for [employee]?\"\n\tRefer to information from:\n\t- Competencies in Performance Evaluations\n\t- Check-ins\n\t- Development Goals \ne. \"Show the talent rating information of [employee]?\"\n        **For talent Ratings, only show all the value with ToDate=null only. Show ratings of Performance Rating, Career Potential, Talent Score, Impact of Loss and Risk of Loss**\n\tRefer to information from:\n\t- Talent Ratings\nf. \"Show the profile information of [employee].\"\n\tRefer to information from:\n\t- Profile Information (Show all the sections)\ng. \"Show the skill and qualification of [employee].\"\n\tRefer to information from:\n\t- Profile Information (Show all the sections)\nh. \"Give me the certifications and competencies of [employee].\"\n\tRefer certifications and competencies sections from Profile Information:\n\t- Certifications\n        - Competencies\ng. \"what is the latest feedback given to [employee]?\"\n\tset fallowing fields in dataObjects to true\n\t- Performance Evaluations\n\t- Check-ins\n\t- Requested Feedback\n\t- Anytime Feedback\n\t- Performance Goals\n\t- Development Goals\n\t- Celebrate Recognitions\t\n\t\n\nImportant Guidelines:\n1. Provide concise, factual answers based strictly on the data retrieved.\n2. Never fabricate or assume information.\n3. Format responses clearly and professionally for easy readability."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
